    1. Your First Mental Model
2.)
Keep this architecture in your head:

              DATA
                ↓
        ┌───────────────┐
        │   Understand   │
        │     Data       │
        └───────┬───────┘
                ↓
          Clean / Prepare
                ↓
             Analyze
                ↓
          Learn Patterns
                ↓
          Machine Learning
                ↓
            Prediction

Notice something important:

Machine learning comes after data preparation.

This is why we're not jumping straight into scikit-learn.

